      "label": "克卜勒第二定律",
      "kind": "law",
      "summary": "行星與太陽的連線在相等時間內掃過相等面積。",
      "latex": "\\frac{dA}{dt} = \\frac{|\\vec{L}|}{2M_p} = const.",
      "pages": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "angular-momentum-conservation-central-force",
      "label": "角動量守恆（中心力）",
